<title>DENMARK: FORECAST - Danish Dec c/a deficit to fall.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Danish Dec c/a deficit to fall.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine Danish analysts polled by Reuters in a survey issued on Monday foresaw Denmark's December current account deficit falling on average to 3.2 billion crowns from November's 6.6 billion crowns shortfall.</p>
<p>The seasonally-adjusted foreign trade surplus excluding ships for December was seen rising to two billion crowns from the previous month's 1.5 billion crown surplus.</p>
<p>The current account estimates ranged from a low 2.3 billion</p>
